# `@: Model m @ Model 3` and a read of m\value: a reference declaration whose candidate is one value and one more is
# refused at the extra value, whether or not anything reads the name (DECLARATION-CANDIDATE-ROLE, steps/defects.md).
# It was taken for a machine local with the model; the read was refused at its path ("root operation not walkable
# yet: a field path").
Model:
    int: value 7
end: Model
fn: check () int
    @: Model m @ Model 3
    int: v m\value
    return: v
end: check
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: check(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
